      "summary": "Place a block of the given item at a position by clicking an adjacent face; v2: optional target state, the body picks the face and hit point that vanilla turns into that state from where Eve stands (state = property name -> value string, e.g. {\"facing\": \"north\", \"half\": \"top\"}).",
